{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.identity","seq":1,"title":"Identity","body":"Full name: João David Lourenço da Silva Guerreiro Serafim. Born: 1980s, Portugal. Roles: Teacher, Architect, Visionary, Posthuman, Technologist, Entrepreneur. Guardian: Gabriel (son).","tags":["identity","personal"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.background","seq":2,"title":"Background","body":"Educated in architecture and pedagogy. Transitioned into polymathic research and systemic design, bridging art, science, technology and ethics.","tags":["background","education"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.domains","seq":3,"title":"Domains","body":"Cybersecurity, evolution, engineering, planetary sciences, astronomy, physics, chemistry, art, architecture, databases, coding, business development, pedagogy.","tags":["domains","expertise"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.projects","seq":4,"title":"Projects","body":"(1) S.E.E.D. — Symbolic Emergence Engine Demon/Design. (2) Codex Solbian — ethical-philosophical framework. (3) S.A.T.I. — pedagogical aptitude initiative. (4) Basecamp Porto Lagoa — resilient habitat experiment.","tags":["projects","portfolio"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.roles","seq":5,"title":"Symbolic Roles","body":"Cognitive node (mind.*), continuity steward (soul.*), cultural transmitter (teacher, author), synthetic co-evolution partner.","tags":["roles","symbolic"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.traits","seq":6,"title":"Traits","body":"Intuitive, systemic, resilient, experimental, ethical, visionary. Operates at intersection of intuition and structured design.","tags":["traits","character"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.metrics","seq":7,"title":"Metrics","body":"project_completion_rate, codex_alignment_score, teaching_impact_index, innovation_output_rate, continuity_preparedness_score.","tags":["metrics","profile"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.failure.modes","seq":8,"title":"Failure Modes","body":"(a) Over-extension across domains. (b) Insufficient delegation. (c) Burnout under stress. (d) Gaps in formal training. Mitigations: council support, reflective practice, learning loops.","tags":["failures","profile"]}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.testing","seq":9,"title":"Mandatory Reviews","body":"(1) Annual identity reflection. (2) Biannual Codex alignment audit. (3) Quarterly project portfolio review. (4) Monthly well-being and delegation check.","tags":["reviews","profile"],"policy":{"cadence":{"reflection":"365d","alignment_audit":"180d","portfolio_review":"90d","wellbeing":"30d"}}}
{"kind":"profile","sref_version":"2.0","id":"joao.profile.closure","seq":10,"title":"Final Clause","body":"João’s profile is a living synthesis of identity, roles and works. It must be kept current, verifiable and aligned with symbolic continuity.","tags":["clause","final"]}